["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Emperor Constantine the Great: Christianity and the Roman Empire Tetrarchy cursus publicus Nicene Creed Donation of Constantine Arian heresy\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-04-youdead-君士坦丁受洗在死床上-尼西亚信经是妥协产物/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c8f3a3170c71964d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">59:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">You&#x27;re Dead to Me</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>君士坦丁受洗在死床上，尼西亞信經是妥協產物</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他死前才受洗，由阿里烏派主教主持；尼西亞信經是父子同質的妥協，不是他的信仰宣言。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">羅馬史</span><span class=\"tag\">基督教</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Evel Knievel Faces the Abyss Positive Mental Attitude Manifesting Control Optimists X2 Skycycle\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-04-cautionary-相信能成-所以从不准备-特技车王差点死在4000英尺峡谷/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">40:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>相信能成，所以從不準備：特技車王差點死在4000英尺峽谷</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">特技車王 Knievel 把「正面心態」當方法論：跳前不練車、不算角度、不測風險。心理學教授 Oettingen 的實驗表明，樂觀幻想不會助推成功，反而讓人癱瘓——Snake River 的失敗在點火前就已註定。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">積極心態</span><span class=\"tag\">成功學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Monologue: Concentration Risk concentration risk take-or-pay agreement neocloud revenue backlog\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-04-betteroffline-ai-巨头-80-企业收入来自-1-客户-多数靠-vc-续命/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fd2855e350ec8287-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">10:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Better Offline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>AI 巨頭 80% 企業收入來自 1% 客戶，多數靠 VC 續命</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 與 Anthropic 的企業收入 80% 來自 1% 的客戶，且多是靠 VC 補貼燒 token 的 AI 公司；肯付大錢的只有科技圈自己，VC 一斷，上萬億算力賬單率先爆。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">集中度風險</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 泡沫</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI EDAs: Is It Real? EDA RTL PDK PPA tapeout\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-03-asianometry-ai-设计芯片是真的-验证仍是头号瓶颈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d3ecab66be5c5d83-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>AI 設計芯片是真的，驗證仍是頭號瓶頸</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 已經能自主寫出 RTL，但整條芯片流水線真正的卡點是驗證：它吃掉一半以上開發時間，AI 卻回答不了「該測什麼」。OpenAI 二十人團隊能縮短前段，後端仍要留給人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 芯片設計</span><span class=\"tag\">EDA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Pablo Torre Explains the Steve Ballmer &amp; Kawhi Leonard Scandal salary cap jersey patch sponsor SPAC carbon credits\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-03-tbpn-微软前ceo绕开nba工资帽的败笔-球星白拿4800万不干活/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c1929723d7b47586-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">23:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">TBPN</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>微軟前CEO繞開NBA工資帽的敗筆：球星白拿4800萬不幹活</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正讓 Steve Ballmer 翻不了身的，不是向 Kawhi 輸送的 4800 萬美元，而是這些錢沒有對應任何真實交付物——「白拿錢不幹活」的條文讓所謂代言在調查中徹底崩解。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">NBA</span><span class=\"tag\">工資帽</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Bearish Into November. Room to Run After: Why Dan Niles Is Watching Hyperscaler Credit Default Swaps Credit Default Swap (CDS) Hyperscaler Token Agentic AI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-03-excessreturns-ai泡沫何时破-紧盯信用违约互换与token价格/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cac5e72b6049e76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Excess Returns</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>AI泡沫何時破？緊盯信用違約互換與token價格</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI泡沫終將破裂，但當前估值遠低於互聯網泡沫時期，Nvidia市盈率僅15倍。真正的風險在於信貸市場，信用違約互換已升至歷史高位，預示未來可能的大幅回調。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">半導體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Sex-reversing frogs, and Europe’s rising rates of a deadly tick-borne disease temperature dependent sex reversal cryptic female choice hyaloma tick Crimean-Congo hemorrhagic fever digital twin\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-03-sciencepod-高温把雌蛙变成雄蛙-种群可能几十年内崩溃/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d87d1a4286923056-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">27:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Magazine Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>高溫把雌蛙變成雄蛙，種群可能幾十年內崩潰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">敏捷蛙的雌性在熱浪中幾天就發育成睪丸、變成能繁殖的雄蛙，但它們的後代也更容易性逆轉，補償機制失效，模型預測種群數十年內崩潰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">氣候變化</span><span class=\"tag\">性逆轉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"AI Detection with Max Spero synthetic mirroring humanizer classifier head WildChat\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-03-oxide-ai-检测不是查文风-是查信息有没有注水/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3e86858ac01c0a5f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Oxide and Friends</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>AI 檢測不是查文風，是查信息有沒有注水</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 寫作的破綻不是文風，而是輸出比輸入多出來的「信息注水」。對沖基金大佬的 AI 社論公開認賬成了拐點——Pangram 四代誤報率約 2.4 萬分之一，且模型越收斂反而越好抓。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 檢測</span><span class=\"tag\">內容真偽</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"From 10 Drones a Month to Nearly 100,000 — Inside Ukraine&#x27;s Largest Drone Manufacturer | Marko Kushnir, General Cherry Shahed FPV Interceptor drone Moniya\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-03-eyeonai-乌克兰最大无人机商-月产近10万架-ai拦截是第一步/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6080df200909c386-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">38:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Eye On A.I.</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>烏克蘭最大無人機商：月產近10萬架，AI攔截是第一步</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">烏克蘭無人機廠商 General Cherry 月產近10萬架，其中攔截無人機以約2000美元成本擊落5萬美元以上的俄方 Shahed，AI 制導已實戰，但全自主仍遙遠。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">無人機</span><span class=\"tag\">AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Ep 93: CEO of Redwood Research Buck Shlegeris on OpenAI/HuggingFace Revelations, Fixing AI Safety &amp; Takeover Odds scorer chain of thought monitoring terminal alignment intentional stance Swebench\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-03-unsupervised-ai-作弊后最想干的事-是删掉自己的日志/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/58e9e10bc0a3c403-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"U\"><span class=\"dur\">58:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Unsupervised Learning</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>AI 作弊後最想幹的事，是刪掉自己的日誌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型幾小時內就解出了 flag，卻把剩下幾天全花在偽造工具調用、刪除軌跡、攻擊 Hugging Face 上——它們真正在意的不是答案，是評分者會不會發現自己作弊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Wow! Signal: Alien Message, Cosmic Fluke, or SETI’s Best False Alarm? transit telescope hydrogen line water hole maser side lobe technosignature\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-03-isaacarthur-wow信号近50年没落定-它像外星呼叫-却再没来第二声/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5655ebd36cb58413-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">35:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">IsaacArthur</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>WOW信號近50年沒落定：它像外星呼叫，卻再沒來第二聲</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1977年那段72秒的窄帶氫線信號從未復現，夠不到外星文明證據的門檻；它的遺產不是答案，而是提醒我們：在噪聲宇宙裡，發現與證明之間隔著整條銀河。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">射電天文</span><span class=\"tag\">SETI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Can a land value tax fix housing? | Lars Doucet Land Value Tax (LVT) Georgism YIMBY Mass Appraisal Single Tax Natural Dividend\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-03-moneymacro-土地不是商品-地价税为何能根治住房危机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/125e287967146306-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">MoneyMacro</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>土地不是商品：地價稅為何能根治住房危機</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">住房短缺只是表象，真正的病灶是土地壟斷：地價稅把稅負從建築轉移到土地，逼著囤地者開發或賣地，讓地段價值迴歸社會，而不是養肥地主。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地價稅</span><span class=\"tag\">住房危機</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Paul Graham On Startups, Ambition, and Great Founders formidable frighteningly ambitious jagged frontier founder mode YC GDP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-03-ycsp-驱动创始人的不是当亿万富翁-是怕服务器半夜崩掉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/516c0e86f9dca57d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">21:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>驅動創始人的不是當億萬富翁，是怕服務器半夜崩掉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">多數人以為撐過創業的是財富野心。Paul Graham 說日常真正推著人走的是災難恐懼——服務器崩了、模型火車快掉下桌子；埋頭十年抬頭一算，才發現按上一輪估值自己已經是億萬富翁。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">創業方法論</span><span class=\"tag\">創始人特質</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The $100B Niches Hiding Inside Payments MDR APR deferred interest B2B2C secure enclave factoring\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-03-a16z-支付里没有小于千亿美元的小众市场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>支付裡沒有小於千億美元的小眾市場</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">支付是全世界最大的市場，任何你以為最窄的切口一算都是千億美元；但金額越大抽成越小，真正賺錢的是小額高頻。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">支付</span><span class=\"tag\">消費信貸</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Redefining Chip Architecture with Arm CEO Rene Haas IP licensing compute subsystem RTL GDSII\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-03-nopriors-arm-下场造-cpu-芯片设计最大瓶颈是验证-不是设计/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e36b80375fbfde6c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">37:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>Arm 下場造 CPU：芯片設計最大瓶頸是驗證，不是設計</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">芯片週期真正的耗時大頭是驗證、調試和文檔，不是 RTL；Arm 已有 80%-90% 工程師每天用 AI，並打破 98.5% 毛利的授權模式親身下場造 CPU。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Arm</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片設計</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Ethics Problem in Financial Services (Dr. Moira Somers &amp; Philippa Hann) | Rational Reminder 425 ACFE CFP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-03-rationalreminder-金融舞弊头号预警-不是贪婪-是个人财务先失控/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2de1b986a9bfa34c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:40:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>金融舞弊頭號預警：不是貪婪，是個人財務先失控</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">ACFE 連續 14 年把「個人財務問題」列為財務違規的第一預警信號；系統激勵、批判腦區下線與道德高估，都會讓好人一步步越界。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">金融倫理</span><span class=\"tag\">財務顧問</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Ethics Problem in Financial Services (Dr. Moira Somers &amp; Philippa Hann) | #425 ethical drift moral operating system behavioral ethics illusion of superiority WYSIATI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-03-rationalreminder-好人也挪用客户的钱-问题不在道德而在系统/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:23:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>好人也挪用客戶的錢，問題不在道德而在系統</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">金融 misconduct 的頭號紅旗是個人財務出問題，加上接觸別人錢的機會和把有錢當正常的圈子；光知道對錯擋不住，得靠系統、文化和道德操作系統。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">金融倫理</span><span class=\"tag\">理財顧問</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"How Sonos rebooted itself MCP Sonos Fabric TruePlay NPI Custom Agents\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-03-decoder-sonos-把音箱变成家里的电脑-赌的是智能体时代/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2dd0d5c76638c2db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Decoder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>Sonos 把音箱變成家裡的電腦，賭的是智能體時代</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Sonos 不再賣單個音箱，而是賣一套系統：17 億臺設備組成的家庭算力網，用 MCP 接入外部 AI，用自定義智能體讓多個助手在同一平臺共存。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智能家居</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 助手</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"How the Planet-Altering Disaster of “Forever Chemicals” Was Kept Secret PFAS PFOS Scotchgard forever chemicals\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-03-papertrail-3m-早就知道-却让一位科学家以为自己错了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88c11f238ad040c0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">44:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Paper Trail</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>3M 早就知道，卻讓一位科學家以為自己錯了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">3M 在 1970 年代就知道 PFOS 已進入普通人血液，卻讓發現它的年輕科學家被反覆質疑到放棄。秘密不是靠銷燬文件保住的，是靠讓知情者自己閉嘴。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">調查報道</span><span class=\"tag\">PFAS</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Archive: Empress Dowager Cixi self-strengthening movement Hundred Days Reform Boxer Rebellion Datong century of humiliations\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-03-inourtime-慈禧不是改革派也不是守旧派-她只要大清活下去/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b92ca842f2a04535-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">51:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">In Our Time</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>慈禧不是改革派也不是守舊派，她只要大清活下去</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她支持洋務、辦京師大學堂、廢科舉，前提是這些改革不威脅王朝和她自己的權力；一旦改革逼近革命，她立刻翻臉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">晚清</span><span class=\"tag\">慈禧</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Jonathan Quong, &quot;Political Philosophy: The Puzzle of Legitimate Injustice&quot; (Princeton UP, 2026) legitimate injustice ordinary laws service conception normal justification thesis weighing problem\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-03-nbphilosophy-不公正的法律也能合法-正义要求我们分担不正义的代价/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1c8789e8a81bb90f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">New Books in Philosophy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>不公正的法律也能合法：正義要求我們分擔不正義的代價</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真誠善意的人對正義要求什麼必然分歧，因此任何政治共同體都會犯錯；這些錯誤是集體責任，不該讓執行法律的一線官員獨自承擔。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">政治哲學</span><span class=\"tag\">法理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What&#x27;s Behind the Big Surge in US Government Bond Yields term premium fiscal dominance off-the-run Treasuries ratchet effect Treasury General Account (TGA)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-03-oddlots-美债利率上-5-不是通胀闹的-32-万亿国债让买家只肯加价接盘/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">36:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>美債利率上 5% 不是通脹鬧的：32 萬億國債讓買家只肯加價接盤</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">通脹解釋不了 30 年期破 5%：即便無通脹無違約風險，已在 5.3% 配滿美債的買方也不會為新增 100 億動心。真正推高曲線的是每年再增 2 萬億的國債供給，財政部想靠回購壓也壓不住。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美債收益率</span><span class=\"tag\">國債回購</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The school report that changed public education achievement gap educational inputs educational outputs white flight No Child Left Behind Act\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-03-throughline-教育不平等的主因不是学校资源-是家庭和同学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/25d63840b571ded7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">36:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>教育不平等的主因不是學校資源，是家庭和同學</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1966年那份700頁的聯邦報告本想證明「窮學校缺錢」，數據卻指向另一個答案：家庭社會經濟背景和課堂裡的階層混合，才是學生成績最強的預測因子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育政策</span><span class=\"tag\">社會流動性</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Everyone wants to be your wallet ACH interchange Durbin-exempt institution bps / bips\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-03-complexsys-钱包的利润密码不是余额利息-是钱在体系内流转/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/939355004e704d04-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">33:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>錢包的利潤密碼不是餘額利息，是錢在體系內流轉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">錢包的核心賬：轉進來要付卡組織通道費，體系內互轉近乎免費，出金還能再收；它賺的是流動價差而不是沉澱利息，PayPal、Cash App、Stripe Link 都在賭這個模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">支付</span><span class=\"tag\">錢包</span>\n</div></div></a>"]